---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="The EGG Show" description="Erudite Growth & Goals: conversations about football, education, and personal development.">
  <section class="egg-hero"><div class="container egg-content"><p class="eyebrow">Erudite Growth & Goals</p><h1>The EGG<br/><span>Show</span></h1><p>Real conversations about football, education, and the people helping young players find their way.</p><a class="btn" href="/apply">Connect with the academy ↗</a></div><div class="egg-watermark" aria-hidden="true">E</div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container show-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">More than match day</p><h2>Stories that<br/>stay with you.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">The EGG Show is a space for the ideas and experiences that shape a player’s journey.</p><p>We’ll share conversations with players, coaches, families, and community voices as episodes become available. Check back for the first stories from the academy.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section-dark"><div class="container empty-show"><div class="show-symbol" aria-hidden="true">E</div><p class="eyebrow">The next conversation is coming</p><h2>Stay close to the game.</h2><p>There are no episodes published yet. In the meantime, learn more about the academy and its player pathways.</p><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/about">Explore the academy ↗</a></div></section>
  <style>.egg-hero{min-height:620px;background:var(--blue);color:white;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}.egg-content{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:5rem 0}.egg-content .eyebrow{color:var(--gold)}.egg-content h1{font-size:clamp(5rem,12vw,10rem)}.egg-content h1 span{color:var(--gold)}.egg-content>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:31rem;color:#e4ebf5;font-size:1.05rem}.egg-watermark{position:absolute;right:6%;font:800 70rem/.7 var(--display);color:#ffffff0e;transform:rotate(-12deg)}.show-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4rem}.lead{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--ink)}.empty-show{text-align:center;max-width:700px}.empty-show>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:500px;margin-inline:auto}.show-symbol{width:4.5rem;height:4.5rem;display:grid;place-items:center;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;background:var(--gold);color:var(--navy);font:800 3rem var(--display)}.empty-show h2{font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,5rem)}@media(max-width:700px){.show-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}.egg-watermark{right:-30%;font-size:45rem}}</style>
</SiteLayout>
